Eventechs grew out of the freelance systems I kept getting asked to build: registration pages, QR check-in, tournament brackets, data collection on the floor. Agencies needed the same things on every event and were stitching them together from five vendors.

So I packaged it.

## What Eventechs does

- Branded registration, ticketing and QR check-in
- On-site tech: kiosks, badges, VIP access
- Digital activations and games for stands and brand zones
- Esports: online and offline tournaments, console and PC setups, tournament management, including for brands outside gaming
- Live dashboards during the event and a data report after it

It's early, and I'm adding to it project by project.
